Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat+fix: methodology improvements & critical bug fixes
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

IMPROVEMENTS (from verified LIVRE MANHADJIYA):
- New verb card 'اكتب نصا علميا' (Composer, 12th verb) with the complete
  annotated 3AS example from the book (صناع الوراثة, exercice 1, 5ن):
  مقدمة/عرض/خاتمة structure + 4 scoring criteria (cos_c1..c4 + scorer branches)
- Tutor Q&A +3 entries (19 → 22): mots-clés 3AS with decoded examples
  (جزيئات حيوية/مهمة, أحماض أمينية موسومة), complete scientific-text guide
  (p.21: steps + no-rote + 1-or-2-part problem), full model answer 3AS

CRITICAL BUGS FIXED:
- methodologyScorer: criteria undefined guard (criteria || []) — prevents crash
- MethodologyCompiler: verbs without a simulator exercise no longer show a
  misleading analyse exercise — clear amber banner + simulator button disabled
  ('قريباً') in the verbs reference tab
- App: localStorage reads/writes wrapped in try/catch (corrupted data or
  private browsing no longer crashes or blocks the app)
- Service worker now registered (main.tsx, production only) — the app shell
  and 44 lesson files were cached by sw.js but NEVER registered => app was
  never actually offline; now fixed
- metadata.json: removed MAJOR_CAPABILITY_SERVER_SIDE_GEMINI_API (app is 100%
  offline)
- package.json: renamed react-example → kunz-el-ouloum v1.0.0 + description
- tsconfig: added vite/client types (import.meta.env.PROD typé)
- README updated (12 verbs, offline)
